matches your plans when the clock strikes midnight.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"center","type_preset":"h5","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_nkMLhX"],"name":"t:names.pull_quote","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":16,"section_width":"page-width","section_height":"","section_height_custom":50,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","padding-block-start":20,"padding-block-end":20}},"section_jRWEj7":{"type":"section","blocks":{"image_PqwtNA":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/22343521_52653846_1000.webp","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/black-strapless-dress-christopher-esber-women-15495073268092","image_ratio":"portrait","width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"group_Ppxth3":{"type":"group","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":12,"width":"custom","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fill","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"text_KQyVEx":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>The Edgy Downtown Edit<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"h3","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_WJQBMX":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>If your ideal New Year’s Eve is more rooftop party and warehouse sound system than black-tie ballroom, lean into an edgy, directional silhouette with unexpected cut lines and attitude-filled details.<\/p><p>Christopher Esber takes the downtown mood into elevated territory. The <a href=\"\/products\/asymmetrical-draped-dress-christopher-esber-women-15495056916860\" title=\"\/products\/asymmetrical-draped-dress-christopher-esber-women-15495056916860\">Asymmetrical Draped Dress<\/a> pairs soft jersey with artful draping and custom beach-glass hardware, creating a fluid silhouette that moves with you on the dance floor. For something even sleeker, the <a href=\"\/products\/black-strapless-dress-christopher-esber-women-15495073268092\" title=\"\/products\/black-strapless-dress-christopher-esber-women-15495073268092\">Black Strapless Dress<\/a> offers a corseted, long-line shape finished with the brand’s signature Arced U Prong hardware, a modern, sculptural detail that turns a classic black gown into a conversation piece.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_MViWMT":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>The <a href=\"\/products\/damami-dress-diesel-women-black\" title=\"\/products\/damami-dress-diesel-women-black\">D-Amami Dress<\/a> by Diesel brings a cool, deconstructed energy to NYE. Its slim fit, spaghetti straps, and sheer overlay with a glimpse of transparency at the legs feel effortless yet intentional, perfect with stacked bangles, sharp boots, and a leather jacket for an after-midnight finish.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"image_jxDaMR":{"type":"image","name":"t:names.image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/25793723_57250836_1000.webp","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/damami-dress-diesel-women-black","image_ratio":"adapt","width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fill","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"padding-block-start