tic, almost gothic edge. Meanwhile, the <a href=\"\/products\/floral-lace-short-dress-rabanne-women-15546867941756\">Floral Lace Short Dress<\/a> balances long sleeves and a round neckline with a shorter length and floral lace texture, perfect for cocktail parties or more relaxed celebrations.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"image_UJXydr":{"type":"image","name":"t:names.image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/31146660_60727239_1000.webp","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/floral-lace-short-dress-rabanne-women-15546867941756","image_ratio":"adapt","width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fill","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_6imbC9":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Finish these looks with high-shine accessories: metallic sandals, crystal earrings, and a sleek clutch. Keep makeup luminous with a sculpted highlight or a bold lip to complement the dresses’ high-impact shine.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_J8wC6Y","image_UJXydr","text_